  "description": {
   "en": "Twenty-nine-year-old Tsutsumi Mika met the elite and handsome SP Mikashima Shihou at an omiai (marriage meeting). Despite thinking he is way out of her league, who is a plain woman, she received a hot proposal and they got married!\nTheir unexpected newlywed life is happiness itself. However, Mika doesn’t understand why he treats her so preciously, making her feel uncertain…\nA fateful love story where deep love is born from an arranged marriage."
  },
